WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.279 --> 00:00:04.859
What happens to a can of pepper spray when
it's introduced to SCP-914?

00:00:04.859 --> 00:00:07.279
Dr. Greer decided to find out.

00:00:07.279 --> 00:00:12.730
Three unopened cans of Fox Labs "White Lightning"
brand pepper spray were selected for testing.

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:15.759
The first can was placed in the machinery
on the setting "Rough."

00:00:15.759 --> 00:00:21.230
The output produced was several piles of metal
and plastic scraps, several puddles of chemicals,

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:24.410
and a puddle of oleoresin capsicum.

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:28.680
The second can was placed inside on the setting
"1:1," and produced an unopened spray can

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:32.180
of Fox Labs "Mean Green" brand pepper spray.

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:36.989
The third can was placed on the setting "Very
Fine," and the output produced was one miniature

00:00:36.989 --> 00:00:38.339
chili pepper.

00:00:38.339 --> 00:00:43.020
When tested, the pepper was found to have
a Scoville heat rating of over 300,000,000,

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:45.699
which would make it the hottest pepper in
the world.

